{"parse":{"title":"Liste der Studentenverbindungen in Frauenfeld","pageid":11995248,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Die <b>Liste der Studentenverbindungen in</b> <b>Frauenfeld</b> verzeichnet die 4 aktiven <a href=\"/wiki/Studentenverbindung\" title=\"Studentenverbindung\">Studentenverbindungen</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Frauenfeld\" title=\"Frauenfeld\">Frauenfeld</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> welche unterschiedlichen <a href=\"/wiki/Korporationsverband\" title=\"Korporationsverband\">Korporationsverbänden</a> angehören oder verbandsfrei sind.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Liste\">Liste</h2></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Name\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Gründung\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\" class=\"unsortable\">Farben\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\" class=\"unsortable\">Wappen\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\" class=\"unsortable\">Zirkel\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Verband\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Fechtfrage\n</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Mitglieder\n</th>\n<th>Anmerkungen\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KTV Concordia<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td>\n<td>1868</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<table class=\"centered\" style=\"width:60px; border: 1px solid; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:gold; height:1px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:red; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:white; height:9px\">\n</td><